  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden (agent proxy: no rule or network setting allows this host)>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Ishaan ke account mein achanak pachaas crore aaye, aur caller bola, shaam tak bhej do. Sahi kya tha? Jawab ye raha!",
      "start": 0.06,
      "end": 6.29,
      "startFrame": 2,
      "endFrame": 189
    },
    {
      "text": "A, turant bank aur cyber police ko batao.",
      "start": 6.6,
      "end": 8.775,
      "startFrame": 198,
      "endFrame": 263
    },
    {
      "text": "Pehla, ek nau teen zero par call, ya cybercrime dot gov dot in.",
      "start": 8.88,
      "end": 12.555,
      "startFrame": 266,
      "endFrame": 377
    },
    {
      "text": "Doosra, bank ko call karke account freeze karwao.",
      "start": 12.75,
      "end": 15.465,
      "startFrame": 382,
      "endFrame": 464
    },
    {
      "text": "Teesra, paisa mat chhuo, mat bhejo, bas screenshots rakho.",
      "start": 15.57,
      "end": 18.945,
      "startFrame": 467,
      "endFrame": 568
    },
    {
      "text": "Isliye, kyunki yeh money mule ka jaal hai, chori ka paisa tumhare naam se ghumta hai, phanste tum ho.",
      "start": 19.14,
      "end": 24.315,
      "startFrame": 574,
      "endFrame": 729
    },
    {
      "text": "Ek viewer ne bilkul sahi pakda, dekho!",
      "start": 24.57,
      "end": 26.505,
      "startFrame": 737,
      "endFrame": 795
    },
    {
      "text": "Account toh bach gaya, par Ishaan ke do hazaar? Woh AI lekar bhaag gaya!",
      "start": 26.67,
      "end": 30.645,
      "startFrame": 800,
      "endFrame": 919
    },
    {
      "text": "Tumhare saath kabhi aisa hua? Comment karo.",
      "start": 30.81,
      "end": 32.625,
      "startFrame": 924,
      "endFrame": 979
    },
    {
      "text": "Agli reel mein, ek anjaan parcel, aur andar ek OTP. Follow karo @rehanfact!",
      "start": 32.79,
      "end": 37.725,
      "startFrame": 984,
      "endFrame": 1132
    }
  ],
